  spellName: Restore Spell
  keyword: Renovae
  description: 'Spell Name: Restore


    Incantation Word: Renovae


    "Not every
    wound is meant to remain. What has withered may bloom again, what has been tainted
    may be made pure, and what has fallen into ruin may yet stand renewed. The world
    endures because there are those who answer decay with restoration instead of
    surrender."'
